# Maintain agent rules

When a recurring workflow changes, update the matching rule in `.agents/rules/` in the same task. `.cursor/rules/` holds symlinks — edit the canonical file under `.agents/rules/`.

| What changed | Rule file |
|---|---|
| Pages, scenarios, SQL, outlets, probes, sign-in, backend tests, deploy and CI | `.agents/rules/service-workflow.mdc` |
| When to run lint and tests before "done" | `.agents/rules/verify-before-done.mdc` |
| Long shell (`make test-integration`, `make test-e2e`, docker) | `.agents/rules/shell-long-commands.mdc` |
| How rules themselves are maintained | this file |
| Human overview of the layout | `docs/engineering/agents.md` |

Rules are short checklists. Do not copy them into `docs/engineering/agents.md`.
